    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέμω</span>
			, only used in pres. and impf. (exc.
				fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρομήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					214.36
				</span></i>
			); of flies, <i>buzz</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.642
			</span></i>; of wind, <i>roar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύελλαι β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.787
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				596
			</span></i>; of boiling broth, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				68.5
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶσα Διὶ βρομέει</span>,
			of a proud person, <i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
				1.13
			</span></i>.</div>
